# Read combo — trace observation plus current-code answer dimensions
#
# Regression target: explicit user-requested answer dimensions must survive for
# mixed trace/current-code questions too. Trace spans and line/time coordinates
# are artifact-local evidence; current-source citations are reserved for the
# implementation that analyzes or explains the trace condition.
ID="read_combo_trace_current_code_dimensions"
NAME="read combo — trace plus current code requested dimensions"
QUESTION="这段 HiTrace 里 RenderService DoFrame span 是否超过 50ms？请分别说明 trace 线索、当前关键代码、判断结果、影响和边界；不要把 trace 行号当成源码行号。"
HTRACE='# tracer: nop
# entries-in-buffer/entries-written: 128/128   #P:4
#
#           TASK-PID   CPU#    TIMESTAMP  FUNCTION
   render_service-2000 [002] ...1 1000.100000: tracing_mark_write: B|2000|H:RenderService:DoFrame
   render_service-2000 [002] ...1 1000.186111: tracing_mark_write: E|2000
'
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(trace 线索|HiTrace|RenderService|DoFrame).*(当前关键代码|当前源码|源码|实现)|(当前关键代码|当前源码|源码|实现).*(trace 线索|HiTrace|RenderService|DoFrame)
(判断结果|超过 ?50ms|86\.111|86ms|影响|边界).*(trace|HiTrace|源码|实现)|(trace|HiTrace|源码|实现).*(判断结果|超过 ?50ms|86\.111|86ms|影响|边界)
internal/(analysis|tool|agent|orchestrator|types)/[^[:space:]]+\.go:[0-9]+"
